OL,3,ACalls for GPS monitoring of domestic
OL,4,Aabuse suspects after murder
OL,5,
OL,6,FDomestic abuse campaigners are calling
OL,7,Ffor greater use of location tracking
OL,8,Ftechnology to monitor high-risk
OL,9,Fsuspects following the murder of a
OL,10,Fwoman in Renfrewshire last month.
OL,12,FAn online petition is calling for a
OL,13,F"Stacy's law" in memory of Stacy Hunter
OL,14,Fwho was killed at her home near Houston
OL,15,Fby her estranged husband while he was
OL,16,Fon bail.
OL,18,FScottish ministers have previously
OL,19,Ffaced criticism over the slow rollout
OL,20,Fof Global Positioning System (GPS)
OL,21,Fequipment, which is used far less in
OL,22,FScotland than in some other countries.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
