OL,3,ACalls for GPS monitoring of domestic
OL,4,Aabuse suspects after murder
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Scottish government said it was
OL,7,Flistening to victims and support
OL,8,Forganisations and would carefully
OL,9,Fconsider the petition.
